  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="f-10" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;9. See Regulatory Matters and Commitments and Contingencies footnotes in Notes to Financial Statements on pages 122 and 123, for the status of materially important legal proceedings pending, and the results of any such proceedings culminated during the year.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
