  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="f-13" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;13. Gail M. Zody-Serbia resigned as Vice President of Human Resources, effective July 28, 2026.&lt;br/&gt;Ty C. Freeland was named Vice President of Human Resources, effective September 28, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
